[{:adr/why-not-observers "ResizeObserver/IntersectionObserver need getBoundingClientRect/layout-box geometry, which is NOT currently exposed to the script context (the compat shim has no geometry access -- confirmed quickjs_wasm.cljc L2619). That is a larger host-side prerequisite (a :layout/box capability + cross-layout-pass plumbing), deferred to L3; FormData/Blob/File were chosen for L2 because they fit the model cleanly and are reliably verifiable on real QuickJS.", :adr/related ["2607091300-devtools-l0-to-l1-inspector" "2607091400-html-parser-l1-to-l2-adoption-agency"], :adr/status :accepted, :adr/id "2607091900", :adr/matrix-correction "Owner matrix said MutationObserver/ResizeObserver/IntersectionObserver/drag&drop unimplemented, but MutationObserver is ALREADY fully implemented (matrix was stale). Real remaining gaps: Resize/Intersection observers, Shadow DOM, DnD, Selection/Range, FormData/Blob/File (this L2 fills the last).", :adr/pins-advanced "{:browser \"9b993bbdf22e45f224017e285d3b5ac7d4f89d3f -> d6a947527a3319e3f33a37300607ee87485486dc\"}", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/decision "L2 = the binary & form-data Web platform APIs (FormData + Blob + File), pure-data structures that cleanly fit the engine's deterministic capability-based model (no geometry needed). Blob byte-faithful via inline UTF-8 codec (String/Blob/ArrayBuffer/typed-array parts, size/type/slice incl negative/text/arrayBuffer). File = Blob + name/lastModified (File.prototype = Object.create(Blob.prototype) so instanceof Blob/File both hold). FormData full map API + String/Blob/File values + new FormData(formEl) enumerating submittable controls (reusing existing __kotobaFormControl/__kotobaControlValue/__kotobaDisabledControl helpers).", :adr/date "2026-07-09", :adr/level-before "{:web-platform-api :L1}", :db/id -1, :adr/test-status "JVM 700/3274/0 (source-presence + no regression); CLJS node-test on real QuickJS WASM 185/278/0 incl. new end-to-end Blob/File/FormData smoke (PASS); lint 0 errors", :adr/superproject-west-commit "29dbf2a01306d781ab2bb7a811720815a76a4e7d", :adr/L3-deferred "Blob.stream() (no ReadableStream); fetch() accepting a FormData body (multipart encoding); input[type=file] yielding real File entries into FormData; ResizeObserver/IntersectionObserver (need layout-box host capability); Shadow DOM; Drag & Drop; Selection/Range", :adr/level-after "{:web-platform-api :L2}", :adr/scope ["orgs/kotoba-lang/browser (compat/quickjs_wasm.cljc: Blob/File/FormData shim)" "manifest/west.yml pin advance (browser)"], :adr/child-merge-commit "{:browser \"d6a947527a3319e3f33a37300607ee87485486dc\"}", :adr/title "Web platform API L1 (stub) -> L2 (Blob + File + FormData) -- browser compat"}]